&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate is a technical thought leader with strong customer facing skills, capable of bridging business objectives with technical solutions. In this role, you’ll serve as a trusted advisor, guiding clients on how to leverage ClickHouse for real time analytics, cloud native applications, and enterprise-scale workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
