&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;At VitalCaring, we don’t just provide care - we help patients regain independence and confidence in the place they call home. As a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Certified Occupational Therapy Assistant (COTA)&lt;/span&gt;, you play a vital role in helping patients rebuild the skills they need for daily living following illness or injury.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;This is a role for a COTA who thrives in a &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;field-based, one-on-one care environment&lt;/span&gt; and is passionate about making a measurable impact in patients’ lives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Why Join VitalCaring?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Meaningful, one-on-one patient care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; in the home setting &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Autonomy with support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; – manage your day with guidance from an experienced OT team &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Real impact on functional outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; and quality of life &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative care model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt; with nurses, therapists, and leadership &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
