&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;• Build and maintain strong relationships with referral partners through consistent communication and service excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;• Develop and execute strategies to grow market share and drive referral volume&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;• Track, manage, and document sales activity across referral sources using CRM tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;• Achieve established referral and admission goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Relationship Building &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;• Establish trusted partnerships with hospitals, physicians, case managers, and community stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;• Collaborate closely with clinical and operational teams to support timely and appropriate patient admissions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
