&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is currently seeking an experienced Certified&amp;nbsp;Nurses Aide, CNA&amp;nbsp;for a&amp;nbsp;per-diem&amp;nbsp;opportunity to complete home health&amp;nbsp;visits to adult and geriatric clients located throughout York County, South Carolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
