&lt;div class=&quot;bb-jobs-posting__header&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;bb-jobs-posting__job-details-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;bb-jobs-posting__job-details-item ptor-job-view-department&quot;&gt;Engineering/Technical/Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;bb-jobs-posting__job-details-item ptor-job-view-location&quot;&gt;Bangalore, Karnataka, India&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bb-jobs-posting__content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;bb-rich-text-editor__content ptor-job-view-description public-job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience: 6 + yrs&lt;br&gt;______________________________________________________&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works in requirements like Engineering, Design, Development, and Deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides technical expertise in Big Data space (Apache Spark, Kafka, Flink, Hadoop Stack like M/R, HDFS, Hive, HBase, Flume, Sqoop,etc. NoSQL stores like Cassandra, HBase etc)&lt;/li&gt;
