&lt;li&gt;Analytical and data driven orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raw intellect, talent and energy are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and Agile : understands the demands of a private, high growth company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to be both a leader and hands on &quot;doer&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile of Desired Candidate:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work experience in Technical Development(Coding).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on experience on Core Java or Scala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to functional programming is plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work Experience with third-party libraries and frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong in Algorithms, Data Structure, OOPS Concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Big Data Technologies or distributed computing would be a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;________________________________________________________&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Engineering Bachelors/Masters in Computer Science/IT.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
