&lt;h2&gt;Job description&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design, development, and implementation of software features according to business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain comprehensive design documents.&lt;/li&gt;
